  "body": "as per\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/server-sent-events.html#parsing-an-event-stream\r\n```bom           = %xFEFF ; U+FEFF BYTE ORDER MARK```\r\n\r\nhowever https://unicode.org/faq/utf_bom.html suggests this is the utf-16 encoding BOM?  while EventSource streams are UTF-8 by definition\r\n\r\n... and Blink source uses ` const unsigned char kBOM[] = {0xef, 0xbb, 0xbf};` which looks more like the UTF8 BOM https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/d881ee1842fe9560c34f01ffc8751fb696f6adb4/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/eventsource/event_source_parser.cc\r\n\r\n\r\nError in the spec? or did i miss something... again :)\r\n\r\n",
